WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.100
Meet Dancing with the SARs,
from RHD Labs.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.800
NISAR radar helps reveal a changing Earth
through clouds.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:14.000
Our prototype connects selected radar windows,
PostGIS, and an interactive globe.

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:19.500
Explore a prairie moisture scenario
and a British Columbia slope scenario.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.200
These visuals and readings are simulated.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:28.500
The goal: make complex Earth observations
easier to explore, explain, and validate.

